<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>[ARO Upgrade ALERT] {{ cluster_name | default('Cluster') }} Upgrade Halted</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: {{ color_page_bg | default('#f8f9fb') }};
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: {{ color_heading | default('#101828') }};
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }
    td {
      padding: 0;
    }
    .email-container {
      max-width: {{ email_max_width | default('580px') }};
      width: 100%;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background-color: {{ color_surface | default('#ffffff') }};
      border: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};
      border-top: 4px solid {{ color_fail | default('#b42318') }};
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.05);
    }
    .header-panel {
      padding: 24px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};
    }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background-color: {{ bg_fail | default('#fdecea') }};
      color: {{ color_fail | default('#b42318') }};
      border: 1px solid #fecdca;
    }
    .cluster-title {
      margin: 12px 0 4px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: {{ color_heading | default('#101828') }};
    }
    .subtitle {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #667085;
    }
    .content-panel {
      padding: 20px 24px;
    }
    .callout-box {
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .callout-rbac {
      background-color: {{ bg_warn | default('#fff8e1') }};
      border: 1px solid #fedf89;
      color: #7a4f01;
    }
    .callout-teardown {
      background-color: {{ bg_pass | default('#e6f4ea') }};
      border: 1px solid #b7e1cd;
      color: {{ color_pass | default('#1a7f37') }};
    }
    .section-heading {
      margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: #475467;
    }
    .matrix-table {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .matrix-table td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .matrix-table tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .matrix-label {
      width: 32%;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #344054;
      background-color: #fcfcfd;
    }
    .matrix-value {
      color: #101828;
    }
    .code-block {
      background-color: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-all;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 8px 0;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }
    .cmd-callout {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #fedf89;
      font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, Courier, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 6px 0;
      display: block;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
    .footer-panel {
      padding: 16px 24px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      border-top: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #667085;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: {{ color_page_bg | default('#f8f9fb') }}; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: {{ color_heading | default('#101828') }};">
  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="background-color: {{ color_page_bg | default('#f8f9fb') }}; padding: 20px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table class="email-container" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width: {{ email_max_width | default('580px') }}; width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; background-color: {{ color_surface | default('#ffffff') }}; border: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; border-top: 4px solid {{ color_fail | default('#b42318') }}; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden;">
          
          <!-- Header Panel -->
          <tr>
            <td class="header-panel" style="padding: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};">
              <span class="status-badge" style="display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 12px; background-color: {{ bg_fail | default('#fdecea') }}; color: {{ color_fail | default('#b42318') }}; border: 1px solid #fecdca;">
                {{ badge_fail | default('UPGRADE HALTED ✖') }}
              </span>
              <h1 class="cluster-title" style="margin: 12px 0 4px 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: {{ color_heading | default('#101828') }};">
                {{ cluster_name | default('Cluster') }} Upgrade Halted
              </h1>
              <p class="subtitle" style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #667085;">
                Hard safety gate triggered during automated upgrade execution
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content Panel -->
          <tr>
            <td class="content-panel" style="padding: 20px 24px;">

              <!-- RBAC Callout (Rendered conditionally when RBAC/Permission issue detected) -->
              {% if is_rbac_error | default(false) in [true, 'True', 'true', 1, '1'] %}
              <div class="callout-box callout-rbac" style="border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; background-color: {{ bg_warn | default('#fff8e1') }}; border: 1px solid #fedf89; color: #7a4f01;">
                <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 13px;">
                  ⚠ Action Required: OpenShift RBAC Permission Failure
                </div>
                <div style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
                  The execution account lacks sufficient authorization to complete this operation:
                  <ul style="margin: 4px 0 6px 18px; padding: 0;">
                    <li><strong>Missing Verb:</strong> <code>{{ rbac_missing_verb | default('patch / get / update') }}</code></li>
                    <li><strong>Target Resource:</strong> <code>{{ rbac_missing_resource | default('ClusterVersion / MachineConfigPool / Node') }}</code></li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
                <div style="font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 600;">Remediation Command (Cluster Administrator):</div>
                <code class="cmd-callout" style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #fedf89; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 4px; display: block; word-break: break-all;">
                  {{ rbac_remediation_cmd | default('oc adm policy add-cluster-role-to-user cluster-admin ' ~ (cluster_username | default('<upgrade-service-account>'))) }}
                </code>
              </div>
              {% endif %}

              <!-- Safe Session Teardown Callout -->
              <div class="callout-box callout-teardown" style="border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; background-color: {{ bg_pass | default('#e6f4ea') }}; border: 1px solid #b7e1cd; color: {{ color_pass | default('#1a7f37') }};">
                <strong>✔ Safe Teardown Confirmed:</strong> {{ session_teardown_status | default('Cluster session token revoked and temporary kubeconfig purged from jump host.') }}
              </div>

              <!-- Diagnostic Matrix -->
              <div class="section-heading" style="margin: 10px 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #475467;">
                Failure Diagnostics
              </div>
              <table class="matrix-table" style="width: 100%; border: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-collapse: collapse;">
                <tr>
                  <td class="matrix-label" style="width: 32%; font-weight: 600; color: #344054; background-color: #fcfcfd; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};">Target Cluster</td>
                  <td class="matrix-value" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; color: #101828;">
                    <strong>{{ cluster_name | default('N/A') }}</strong>
                    {% if cluster_tier | default('') | length > 0 %}
                    <span style="font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 6px; background-color: #f2f4f7; border-radius: 4px; color: #344054; margin-left: 6px;">{{ cluster_tier }}</span>
                    {% endif %}
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="matrix-label" style="width: 32%; font-weight: 600; color: #344054; background-color: #fcfcfd; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};">Failed Task</td>
                  <td class="matrix-value" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; color: #101828;">
                    <code>{{ failed_task_name | default('Unknown Task') }}</code>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="matrix-label" style="width: 32%; font-weight: 600; color: #344054; background-color: #fcfcfd; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};">Safety Gate Type</td>
                  <td class="matrix-value" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; color: #101828;">
                    <span style="font-weight: 700; color: {{ color_fail | default('#b42318') }};">{{ failed_gate_type | default('HARD') }}</span> (Immediate Abort)
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="matrix-label" style="width: 32%; font-weight: 600; color: #344054; background-color: #fcfcfd; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};">Observed State</td>
                  <td class="matrix-value" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; color: #101828;">
                    {{ failure_observed | default('Non-zero return code or health validation failure') }}
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="matrix-label" style="width: 32%; font-weight: 600; color: #344054; background-color: #fcfcfd; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }};">Upgrade Hop</td>
                  <td class="matrix-value" style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; color: #101828;">
                    {{ current_cluster_version | default('N/A') }} &rarr; <strong>{{ target_cluster_version | default('N/A') }}</strong>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Error Message / Stack Trace -->
              <div class="section-heading" style="margin: 10px 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #475467;">
                Error Output
              </div>
              <div class="code-block" style="background-color: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; margin: 8px 0; line-height: 1.45;">
{{ failure_reason | default(resolved_error | default('No detailed error output captured from execution host.')) }}
              </div>

              <!-- Next Steps Box -->
              <div style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #f8f9fb; border: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px;">
                <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #344054;">Next Steps & Remediation:</div>
                <ol style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: #475467;">
                  <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;">Inspect the complete execution run log on the jump host:
                    <div style="font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #101828; margin: 3px 0;">
                      {{ log_file_path | default('playbooks/logs/' ~ (cluster_name | default('cluster')) ~ '.txt') }}
                    </div>
                  </li>
                  <li style="margin-bottom: 4px;">Resolve root cause identified in the diagnostic table above.</li>
                  <li>Re-run upgrade with <code>--resume</code> flag to resume from the interrupted phase.</li>
                </ol>
              </div>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer Panel -->
          <tr>
            <td class="footer-panel" style="padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid {{ color_border | default('#e4e7ec') }}; font-size: 12px; color: #667085; line-height: 1.4;">
              <div><strong>Generated:</strong> {{ report_timestamp | default((ansible_date_time.iso8601 if (ansible_date_time is defined and ansible_date_time.iso8601 is defined) else 'N/A')) }}</div>
              <div><strong>Execution Host:</strong> {{ ansible_hostname | default('localhost') }} (Ansible {{ (ansible_version.string if (ansible_version is defined and ansible_version.string is defined) else '2.x') }})</div>
              <div style="margin-top: 4px;">Automated notification from ARO Cluster Upgrade Engine &bull; Do not reply directly to this message.</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
